%%{init: {"themeVariables": {"fontFamily": "Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"}, "sequence": {"width": 230, "actorMargin": 160, "noteMargin": 14, "wrap": false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Test runner
    participant C as TestParseInterfaces
    R->>C: setUpClass() once: read fixtures/interfaces.xml
    loop each method whose name starts with test
        R->>C: setUp(): fresh self.intfs
        R->>C: test_enabled_is_bool()
        Note over C: pass "." / AssertionError "F" / other exception "E"
        R->>C: tearDown(): runs even if the test failed
    end
    R->>C: tearDownClass() once
    Note over R,C: Order inside a class = alphabetical by method name. Never rely on it.
